  "Description":      "Personal Status Extraction, the composite of the Figure 2 of the specification: each of the four media (Text, Speech, Face, Body) enters as the medium, which Entity Text / Speech / Face / Body Description describes, or as its descriptors, which go straight to the interpretation; PS-Text / PS-Speech / PS-Face / PS-Body Interpretation give the Personal Status of the modality, and Personal Status Multiplexing gives the Entity Personal Status of the modalities that arrived. The instances are: the GoEmotions text description and interpretation, the wav2vec 2.0 affect description (non-commercial licence) and interpretation of the speech, the HSEmotion expression description and interpretation of the face, the BlazePose keypoints and the first, rule-based interpretation of the body. The input selectors of the specification are not wired: no Description AIM has a Selector port; what enters decides what is used.",

